<description>&lt;p&gt;JNIM militants have struck 30 locations across Mali, intensifying attacks that prompted calls for dialogue, while gunmen in Nigeria's Niger state killed a village head, several others, and five worshippers in a mosque reprisal. Fulani civilians have been killed in retaliatory attacks after the village leader's murder, with dozens reported dead. Benin is increasing operations against jihadists near the Nigeria border. The Sahel jihadist insurgency caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Traverse City Record-Eagle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNMDNqdlUyZlpGVkNnZG5xRWQ5YkVDNXBrSkxBdVpFUWZ3U1g4UWxYYk9SbF9CajdHdk5xYnNNQUZHbkU4emRHNDFvTS1tanRwVTllVmdFTFM5dW9VZVNIVFlXQ3VLYTRTbWxmM29XaHlFWFk1R0FhVENjQXVGUUN5VnFmTmcycDgyY2Iw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOZ2Z6b0JoMkN0b01tUzFLcWhCTlF2Rlh1RzlBZGtkVFM2R1RIVjFWMUZyb25ZOXYtQ0taaWlXWG9vaTYwbHF0NktIQllaNjZPZ0J6SERhQklFeU9PcWltWFAwa28wQVBzaWdwRzdscUtyeER1ZG9fdFNOY19xTnIxbzZ0bFRVXzJma1lzbFRUeEdKaHRsVF84?oc=5&quot;&gt;Military Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Express Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTFBsbi1oTkZzVU82UGNINGhsTjBMdnl5cUxSMVFlSWVMT2Q3N1VxOERmdFpaRDI1SF9wSHRZY3B5NzY0azB6dzRwSTQ0SDl6dEpQVkgxMDlnTFFrdkZhU2tEMVozNXhONDVvMVR6OVRxU0lLb0x0QWln?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNZTlSMHhXOU8yeFh3RlR2bjZKN1kwTmRlenhJdHJzbmVKY2JoV3c3MkYyWVU1VHRxdEgxeGpXaDNmWm1RMXkxRC1iM0dLb2hXWnYxRk51Y0N5dnlVaUJMVTdzaXFRanFVaV9sWjF1OS1OR0x0QVhwbDBaR0M2Sm9hdFVDRk9waHJ1N1Y4dVZOcS1iMHN1YkkwZDR3LS12SzdkMTJTcFJmRlc?oc=5&